<title>
Rear Seatback and Rear Seat Cushion Disassembly and Reassembly
</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A9706009001">
<title>
Disassembly
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove rear seat. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9706008"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove headrests and headrest guides. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9706007"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove shoulder anchor cover (7)
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove rear side hinge bolts (10), and remove rear side hinge bushings (11).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove tether anchor cover (12) and rear seatback lock bezels (4).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove rear seatback trim (R) / (L) (2) and remove rear seatback pad (R) / (L) (1) from rear seatback frame (R) / (L) (3).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove rear seatback silencers (13).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove rear seatback lock bolts (9), and remove rear seatback locks (6).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove rear seatback lock knobs (5).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A970007.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "154.810mm" ver = "01" gw = "497" gh = "422"/>
