<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A9706009002">
<title>
Reassembly
</title>
<ptxt>
Reverse disassembly procedure noting the following point.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten rear side hinge bolts and rear seatback lock bolts to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T9G006">
<t-part>
Rear seatback lock bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
21
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
2.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
15.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A970008.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "47.741mm" ver = "01" gw = "396" gh = "119"/>
